{"id":4259,"date":"2017-10-06T23:08:15","date_gmt":"2017-10-07T03:08:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=4259"},"modified":"2017-10-06T23:08:15","modified_gmt":"2017-10-07T03:08:15","slug":"review-lake-vandalia-campground","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/10\/06\/review-lake-vandalia-campground\/","title":{"rendered":"Review &#8211; Lake Vandalia Campground"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>As afternoon came we pulled in to a Walmart parking lot where we could get free (strong) wifi and brought up our Allstays app to find a place to stay for the night.<\/p>\n<p>We were lucky enough to choose Lake Vandalia Campground at Vandalia, Illinois.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4263\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4263\" style=\"width: 1368px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/Lake-Vandalia.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4263\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/Lake-Vandalia.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1368\" height=\"619\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/Lake-Vandalia.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/Lake-Vandalia-300x136.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/Lake-Vandalia-768x348.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/Lake-Vandalia-1024x463.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1368px) 100vw, 1368px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4263\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Lake Vandalia, Illinois<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>This is a city park with a huge lake, beach area with concession stand and about 100+ electric only sites.\u00a0 There is a dump station that&#8217;s free to use for registered guests.\u00a0 Water hydrants are available, but you might need a couple hundred feet of hose.\u00a0 We carry 90 gallons in our fresh water tank, so we had no worries.<\/p>\n<p>The fee was only $15 (senior discount) and we were lucky enough to be one of only about 3 or 4 campers there for the night.\u00a0 We backed in to our spot, set up our chairs at the edge of the lake, cooked brats on the charcoal grill and had a peaceful and cool night listening to the light rain that started about midnight.<\/p>\n<p>Oh, and Kathy made Acorn Squash in her Instant Pot &#8230;. I didn&#8217;t think I would like it, but you know &#8230; put enough butter and brown sugar on about anything and it&#8217;ll taste good!\u00a0 I gotta admit &#8230;. it was yummy.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4264\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4264\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-17.14.10.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4264\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-17.14.10.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-17.14.10.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-17.14.10-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-17.14.10-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-17.14.10-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4264\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Acorn Squash from the Instant Pot<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4261\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4261\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-15.54.35.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4261 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-15.54.35.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-15.54.35.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-15.54.35-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-15.54.35-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-15.54.35-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4261\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Our site for the night, backed right up to the lake<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4260\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4260\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-16.03.38.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4260 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-16.03.38.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-16.03.38.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-16.03.38-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-16.03.38-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-16.03.38-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4260\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">View of the lake from our easy chairs<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<div style=\"width: 685px;\" class=\"wp-video\"><video class=\"wp-video-shortcode\" id=\"video-4259-1\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" preload=\"metadata\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"video\/mp4\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-16.26.45.mp4?_=1\" \/><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-16.26.45.mp4\">https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-16.26.45.mp4<\/a><\/video><\/div>\n<p>All in all, it was another great place to camp for the night &#8230; and inexpensive to boot!<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/2017-10-04-15.54.35.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>As afternoon came we pulled in to a Walmart parking lot where we could get free (strong) wifi and brought up our Allstays app to find a place to stay for the night. We were lucky enough to choose Lake Vandalia Campground at Vandalia, Illinois. This is a city park with a huge lake, beach &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/10\/06\/review-lake-vandalia-campground\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Review &#8211; Lake Vandalia Campground<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,586,554707329],"tags":[554707475,18086,554707472,554707474,554707473],"class_list":["post-4259","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-food","category-traveling","tag-bratwurst","tag-lake","tag-squash","tag-texas","tag-vandalia"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4259","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4259"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4259\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4265,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-js